      "content": "If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please reach out for immediate help; you can call or text 988 anytime in the US and Canada. These feelings of unbearable weight and exhaustion are signs of extreme distress, but there is support available to help you find peace without ending your life. Please connect with a crisis hotline right now; they are there to listen without judgment.",
